  "summary": "甲年武贪丑命因廉贞化禄、破军化权、武曲化科形成三奇嘉会；作者以禄的财利、科的才智名声及权的权柄信心解释名利双收。天魁丑、天钺未为坐贵向贵；命宫强旺时陀罗被制煞为用。残首古注不用于补前例。",
  "summary_en": "For Jia-year Wu Qu and Tan Lang in the Chou Life Palace, Lian Zhen Hua Lu, Po Jun Hua Quan and Wu Qu Hua Ke form San Qi Jia Hui. The author links Lu to wealth, Ke to intelligence and reputation, and Quan to authority and confidence. Tian Kui at Chou and Tian Yue at Wei are described as Zuo Gui Xiang Gui; strong palace conditions allow Tuo Luo to be put to use. The incomplete opening quotation is not used to reconstruct the preceding example.",
